{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_F0786637","title":"Thaddeus sends another message","entry":"Dlg_F0786637::entry","exit":"Dlg_F0786637::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_1B60FA74","articyId":"72057645577587389","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Did you see the message from Thaddeus on the news?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did you see the message from Thaddeus on the news?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18734","byteOffset":14973376,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_AB7EF918","articyId":"72057645577587403","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He has been trying to contact you through various channels.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He has been trying to contact you through various channels.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1025.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29557","byteOffset":19060832,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_C84219A7","articyId":"72057645577587424","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He has sent you another message, relayed from Luna. He has told me that sending such messages is costly, but you have not been receiving them through other channels.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He has sent you another message, relayed from Luna. He has told me that sending such messages is costly, but you have not been receiving them through other channels.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1625.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44196","byteOffset":31054216,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_EE1CE42C","articyId":"72057645577587446","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"... Apologies for the distortion in the message. Some of it appears... jumbled.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... Apologies for the distortion in the message. Some of it appears... jumbled.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30701","byteOffset":19495400,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_6262B29A","articyId":"72057645577587454","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"It's like a postcard. But I have to write them backwards, because that's how time flows for me now, unless I really focus the...","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's like a postcard. But I have to write them backwards, because that's how time flows for me now, unless I really focus the...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2525.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50319","byteOffset":33377344,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_C6E67928","articyId":"72057645577587482","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He seems trapped in some philosophical conundrum.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He seems trapped in some philosophical conundrum.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31293","byteOffset":19719776,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_6D2F33CF","articyId":"72057645577587488","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"... She thinks how I used to think. But my mind is clearer now than it's ever been. Her thoughts race down the same highways, but my mind has gone off the road, and carves a new path.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... She thinks how I used to think. But my mind is clearer now than it's ever been. Her thoughts race down the same highways, but my mind has gone off the road, and carves a new path.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51373","byteOffset":33850240,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_A85E0B91","articyId":"72057645577587503","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"... And all of this will make sense at the end. But the end of WHAT? A life contains every story, and where you start and end determines if it's a tragedy or... something else.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... And all of this will make sense at the end. But the end of WHAT? A life contains every story, and where you start and end determines if it's a tragedy or... something else.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4625.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26179","byteOffset":17785688,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_F7ED61B0","articyId":"72057645577587511","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"There is a little more, but the message is incomplete.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There is a little more, but the message is incomplete.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4950.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23987","byteOffset":16954216,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_970047F8","articyId":"72057645577587517","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"How do you know when it's finished? When you've found everything? When you've seen the credits? When you find her? But that's not the end, because the story goes on - if the one sitting in front of the screen wants it to. But that's the layer above -","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do you know when it's finished? When you've found everything? When you've seen the credits? When you find her? But that's not the end, because the story goes on - if the one sitting in front of the screen wants it to. But that's the layer above -","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5250.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26909","byteOffset":18060736,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_516DE352","articyId":"72057606922862313","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":".... ... ...","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":".... ... ...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2600.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35007","byteOffset":25604392,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_8052EC2B","articyId":"72057645577587395","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh?","TextSheVersion":"Huh?","TextTheyVersion":"Huh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":725.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33831","byteOffset":20681848,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_E91C721B","articyId":"72057645577587410","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What are you talking about?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What are you talking about?","TextSheVersion":"What are you talking about?","TextTheyVersion":"What are you talking about?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41056","byteOffset":29861104,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_10A2309C","articyId":"72057645577587415","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I HAVE been receiving more messages from the ether recently.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I HAVE been receiving more messages from the ether recently.","TextSheVersion":"I HAVE been receiving more messages from the ether recently.","TextTheyVersion":"I HAVE been receiving more messages from the ether recently."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27901","byteOffset":18436760,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_A8EB2D75","articyId":"72057645577587432","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So he has been talking with you then?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So he has been talking with you then?","TextSheVersion":"So he has been talking with you then?","TextTheyVersion":"So he has been talking with you then?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21117","byteOffset":15870472,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_1A292682","articyId":"72057645577587438","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Well, play his message.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, play his message.","TextSheVersion":"Well, play his message.","TextTheyVersion":"Well, play his message."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20987","byteOffset":15822072,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_E28CB91E","articyId":"72057645577587461","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It's breaking up Ava.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's breaking up Ava.","TextSheVersion":"It's breaking up Ava.","TextTheyVersion":"It's breaking up Ava."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2825.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31941","byteOffset":19964872,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_86CBE406","articyId":"72057645577587468","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'll try to decode. One moment.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll try to decode. One moment.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3125.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40829","byteOffset":29772888,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_D4126B30","articyId":"72057645577587475","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"... But stoicism just loops around, you see? There are no answers in it, only justifications. They say only to worry about what you can change, but telling a human not to worry is like telling the water in a puddle to be a different shape from the ground that holds it.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... But stoicism just loops around, you see? There are no answers in it, only justifications. They say only to worry about what you can change, but telling a human not to worry is like telling the water in a puddle to be a different shape from the ground that holds it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27275","byteOffset":18199688,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_81386272","articyId":"72057645577587496","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I believe he is talking about me.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I believe he is talking about me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4325.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22618","byteOffset":16443424,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_D2C2C293","articyId":"72057645577587525","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Is that it?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is that it?","TextSheVersion":"Is that it?","TextTheyVersion":"Is that it?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5550.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50092","byteOffset":33293200,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_F9029C5F","articyId":"72057645577587531","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes. There is more but the transmission failed. I am sure his next message will explain all of this.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. There is more but the transmission failed. I am sure his next message will explain all of this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5850.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34082","byteOffset":20775232,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"Dlg_F0786637::entry","type":"entry","text":"Thaddeus sends another message","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[]},{"id":"Dlg_F0786637::exit","type":"exit","text":"Thaddeus sends another message","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[]},{"id":"Ins_51C39E12","type":"external","text":"// wait a moment","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[],"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19936","byteOffset":15426192,"byteLength":356}}],"edges":[{"id":"Dlg_F0786637::entry:72057602627863839:0","from":"Dlg_F0786637::entry","to":"DFr_1B60FA74","fromPin":"72057602627863839","toPin":"72057645577587392","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":0,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"","conditions":[]},{"id":"DFr_1B60FA74:72057645577587393:0","from":"DFr_1B60FA74","to":"DFr_8052EC2B","fromPin":"72057645577587393","toPin":"72057645577587398","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":0,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"","conditions":[]},{"id":"DFr_AB7EF918:72057645577587407:0","from":"DFr_AB7EF918","to":"DFr_10A2309C","fromPin":"72057645577587407","toPin":"72057645577587418","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":0,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"","conditions":[]},{"id":"DFr_AB7EF918:72057645577587407:1","from":"DFr_AB7EF918","to":"DFr_E91C721B","fromPin":"72057645577587407","toPin":"72057645577587413","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":1,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"","conditions":[]},{"id":"DFr_C84219A7:72057645577587428:0","from":"DFr_C84219A7","to":"DFr_A8EB2D75","fromPin":"72057645577587428","toPin":"72057645577587435","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":0,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"","conditions":[]},{"id":"DFr_C84219A7:72057645577587428: